      "sourceTextSha256": "297e8a9c45441f15d0ef7c7bd2fdeea8714a3d7fe80b6fe4d22d5e517aee4abd",
      "text": "\n## Hotels and prices for 2027\n\nPrices per person in USD for the 4-day / 3-night programme. All options include 3 nights in Rio de Janeiro, breakfast and the services in the programme. A hotel of a similar category may be used.\n\n| Category | Hotel and room | SGL | DBL | TRP |\n| --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| 3* | B&B Copacabana, Superior Room + BB + Services | $2607 | $1447 | $1255 |\n| 4* | Windsor Leme, Standard Room + BB + Services | $2847 | $1620 | $1591 |\n| 5* | Miramar by Windsor, Standard Room + BB + Services | $3219 | $1912 | $1755 |\n\n## A short introduction to Rio\n\nTwo 4-hour excursions leave time to relax and explore on your own. From the cable car to Sugar Loaf, you can see Copacabana and Guanabara Bay. The following day, the route through Tijuca Forest takes you to Corcovado and Christ the Redeemer.\n\nYou can choose this trip on its own or add it to a longer journey through South America. An evening show with dinner and a tour of Rocinha are available at an additional cost.\n",
